    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>** Game will appear as Planked In Library</strong>\u00a0**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>** Game will still play as Lights Out: TPP Shooter</strong> **</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LIGHTS OUT: TPP Shooter\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced third-person shooter packed with thrilling gameplay, vibrant visuals, and a dynamic soundtrack. Choose from 8 action-packed game modes, including Conquest, Capture the Flag, Team Deathmatch, Rush, Search and Destroy, Kill Confirmed, Free-for-All, and Insta-Frag. Play solo or with friends in multiplayer, level up, track your stats, and dominate the battlefield in this ultimate shooter experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TPP Shooter - Play single player, or online with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visuals &amp; Music - Experience stunning visual effects and a reactive soundtrack that keeps the hype going.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leveling &amp; Stats - Track your performance and check your stats as you hone your skills and dominate the competition. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insta-Frag Gamemodes - No room for mistakes\u2014every shot counts in this intense, insta-kill game mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Gamemodes - Whether you\u2019re a strategist, a thrill-seeker, or a lone wolf, there\u2019s a mode for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Killstreaks - Dominate the battlefield by unleashing powerful rewards as you rack up consecutive kills. Use your skills strategically to turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VOIP - Lobby voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built-In Gamepad Support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lights Out: TPP Shooter - Release Date: 01-09-2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music Credit: Refresh - Aylex</p>",
